      "created_at": "2020-06-16T18:24:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I feel this episode fulfills my desire to have C&amp;A write an issue that was poorly received. There's just something beautiful about hearing Adam go, \"I hate when comics do that, it's perfect!\"</p>\n<p>Barring the name already being used, of course, I can't believe they didn't name Xander Groovitation \"Moonrock\".</p>\n<p>Okay, but I'm so mad they came up with \"groovitational pull\", because now I wanna use it. XD</p>\n<p>Brian Jewett, I am very disappointed you didn't say \"It was Tuesday.\" :(</p>",
